{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "90e9e49f-503c-83bf-9dfa-3bf8d95612c8",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T15:16:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I call about a pothole. In the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that down. Where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 284 Pelham Street. At the intersection. Near the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 284 Pelham Street, at the corner. Got it. Is this something new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not new. The city patch it three times. Three times. And it open again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three patches and it keeps reopening. Yeah, that happens a lot this time of year with the freeze and thaw. I'm writing that down so they know it's a repeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:13:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. It is right in the bike lane. [pause] The bike lane, you understand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, it's in the bike lane. That's worth noting, I'll put it in the report so it gets looked at as a safety thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. I am calling for my mother. She lives there. I am her son."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, you're calling on behalf of your mom. And what's your name, so I have it on the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anthony Cardillo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Anthony. Could you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "C, A, R, D, I, L, L, O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cardillo, perfect. Do you want a call back number on this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-six. That's what I have. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, [pause] the children are home from school. Winter break. They are very loud today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, I can hear them a little. Totally fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have one question. How long it take, usually? To fix the hole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few days up to a couple of weeks, depending on the weather and how many other calls are ahead of it. In winter they use a cold patch, and that's why it doesn't hold. A real repair comes when it's warm enough for hot asphalt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. So the patch is not, um, permanent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it's temporary. Since this one's failed three times, I'm flagging it for a closer look instead of another quick patch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's 284 Pelham Street, intersection pothole, in the bike lane, patched three times already. Anything else you want me to add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Anthony. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T15:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
